Z||000000||fiero56||05-13-2001||05:44 PM||||I've been kicing this idea around for a month or two now. <BR>I've got an '86SE. I bought the car, just as a second car, with no real intentions for it, other than backup. I have decided I'm tired of driving only manual tranny cars daily in never ending stop-and-go construction traffic(also have 5-speed Formula).<P>Right now, I am deciding if I want to start "upgrading" the SE if I decide to keep it, or trade/sell it for an auto 2.8 and "upgrade" that one. I don't want to start putting money and time into this SE, to just get rid of it afterward.<P>The car:<BR>1986 SE v-6 4-speed, plain roof<BR>Silver ext, grey int<BR>105K miles<BR>All options less rear defrost(power windows, mirrors, locks, cruise, factory sub, deck release, rear wing)<BR>14" tech wheels<P>The good:<BR>New battery<BR>New fuel pump<BR>Newer tires have 5K miles<BR>Interior is almost perfect, a few cigarette burns, and a couple of breaks in the vinyl strip running around the drivers seat<BR>Headliner was recently recovered<BR>Engine seems to be in great shape, no problems<BR>Clutch is solid, no slipping, but it is original<BR>car runs/drives very nicely<P>The bad:<BR>needs new paint(cc is bad, and a few bad areas needing attention)<BR>rear fascia has a 3-4" cut<BR>needs new engine mounts(I will take care of soon)<BR>gas needle does not give correct reading(1/4-1/2 means emtpy)<BR>needs water-pump(shaft is slightly bent so it slowly chews through belts; I will take care of soon)<BR>needs new shock/struts<BR>Will be needing new ball-joints, probably near years end<BR>Some minor vinyl warping inside, but will be taken care of<BR>Driver rocker panel broken, driver front fender has a "chip" missing<P>I would be looking for an '86SE or '87SE(might consider other models/styles) with 2.8 auto in some kind of trade, or sell this car for the right one. I won't be getting rid of this one until at least July, but wondering if I should just keep what I have, or see if there is something interesting I can get with it.<P>For a fee plus parts, I can probably add what you want(sunroof, clutch, etc). Anybody know what I could expect for this car? I will put up pictures later, from my personal computer.<P>Editted as I remember more to post about.<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 05-13-2001).]||||reg||5
